Well, if you've been level drained (can happen due to, e.g., vampires 
or anything wielding Stormbringer), you can kill anything (even 
something wimpy, like a grid bug) to get one level back. You can then 
drink potions of full healing to regain up to half of your lost levels, 
one potion per level. After that, any remaining levels need to be 
regained the hard way.

If you've lost levels due to becoming a new (wo)man (polyself into your 
own race), however, you can only regain those levels the hard way. (You 
can gain or lose up to two levels in this way per poly.)
